WEBVTT

00:06:56.849 --> 00:07:00.000
It strikes me as practically libertarian.

00:07:01.071 --> 00:07:04.094
Is it totalitarian to require
reading, writing and arithmetic?

00:07:04.118 --> 00:07:05.277
I don't think so.

00:07:05.301 --> 00:07:07.280
All I'm saying is --

00:07:07.304 --> 00:07:13.228
and facts, facts only;
no values, just facts --

00:07:13.252 --> 00:07:15.000
about all the world's religions.

00:07:16.683 --> 00:07:18.606
Another reviewer called it "hilarious."

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:23.557
Well, I'm really bothered by the fact

00:07:23.581 --> 00:07:26.200
that anybody would think
that was hilarious.

00:07:26.224 --> 00:07:30.205
It seems to me to be such a plausible,